---
// The end-of-post trigger. Pressing it is the first seeing of the other mode:
// it enters ābhāsa, and by entering unlocks the corner mark that rides every
// page thereafter. Nothing is revealed that the reader has not first walked
// the length of the page to reach. The default remains dassana; this is the
// one door into the appearance, and it is placed at the end on purpose.
---

<button class="luminous-trigger" type="button" data-mindscape-enter>
  Show me the luminous
</button>

<style>
  .luminous-trigger {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 1.6rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--brass);
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--brass);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }
  .luminous-trigger:hover { background: var(--leaf-deep); }
</style>
